title: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › One card
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=actions
intro: Everything on one recommendation card: leaving it out, the question some cards ask, notes to the agent that does the work, the 'Why this matters' note and the links.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the note box saves your words on the case and logs them. The agent does not read them again until the next Apply.
---
screen cd "Recommendation card\nCheckbox, title, pills, bullets, 'Why this matters', agent line, buttons"
process pl "Pills\n'+11 pts' on every card ('+1 pt' for one point)\n'Needs your input' or 'Answer added' on cards that ask a question\n'Added for your focus' on the card that Refine recommendations added"
process bl "Up to three bullets say what the agent will add"
click tk "Click the checkbox or the title"
process tg "Card is included in, or left out of, the draft\nSide-panel count follows\nNothing is logged"

click wy "Click 'Why this matters'"
process wo "A short reason opens under the bullets\nClick again to close"

decision dQ "Does the card ask a question?"
group gQ "Cards with a question"
  input an "Type the answer in the box\ne.g. 'Step-down program and first appointment'"
  decision dA "Is there an answer?"
  process er "After a failed Apply, red text under the box\n'Type your answer before Scribe can apply this.'"
  click sn "Click 'Send note'\n(off until there is an answer)"
  process cp "No caption\nAfter a note: 'Sent to Scribe'"
endgroup

group gN "Cards without a question"
  click an2 "Click 'Add a note'"
  input ni "Type in 'Add context or a note for the agent…'"
  click sn2 "Click 'Send note'\n(off until something is typed)"
  click cn "Click 'Cancel'"
  process cx "The note box closes\nWhat you typed is kept if you open it again"
process sh "Under the card: 'Note sent to Packet: “...”'"
endgroup

store nt "Note saved on the case\nLog: 'You sent Scribe a note: ...'"
toast tn "'Note sent to Scribe'\n'It will be used the next time the draft is updated.'"

agent ag "Agent: badge and name, e.g. 'Scribe', then 'Why this matters'\nScribe writes the plan, Packet attaches documents, Integrity settles dates, Reader finds chart notes, Verify fixes coverage"
decision dL "Is it the coverage card?"
click lk "Click 'Open Eligibility & Benefits'"
goto gE "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › Ways in and pre-fill"
click ds "Click 'Dismiss'"
goto gD "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back"
process lk2 "While the agents are updating the draft\nthe checkbox, answer box, 'Send note' and 'Dismiss' are locked"

cd --> pl --> bl
cd --> tk --> tg
cd --> wy --> wo
cd --> dQ
dQ -->|Yes| an --> dA
dA -->|No| er
dA -->|Yes| sn
sn --> nt
sn --> cp
dQ -->|No| an2 --> ni
ni --> sn2 --> nt
an2 --> cn --> cx
sn2 --> sh
nt --> tn
cd --> ag --> dL
dL -->|Yes| lk --> gE
dL -->|No| ds
lk --> ds
ds --> gD
cd -.-> lk2
